text The bell rings.
text Now that homeroom ─ which seemed to have been filled with malicious stares ─ has finally ended, school is finally over for the day.
text Fujibayashi is the first person to leave the classroom.
text I am not the only one who is watching her as she leaves. About 80% of our classmates are too.
text And just as the door slides shut, all the glares turn to me instead.
text This is making me feel terribly uncomfortable.
text Amid such an atmosphere, I take my bag and stand up.
text As I look around the classroom, all the people who are staring at me look away in a fluster.
text I sigh and walk out of the classroom.
